<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6fd2a7f85679> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1061] The Knightscope K5 security robot’s job is to be on the look out for crime. [1052] The K5 robot... is billed as an 'autonomous presence' that is rented out to malls, office buildings, and parking lots to enforce order with a built-in video camera, license plate recognition, and thermal imaging." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1061" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6fefa640f561> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Officer workers at the Georgetown Harbour office and retail space in Washington D.C. tweeted photos on Monday of the building’s K5 marooned and toppled over in a water fountain." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1061" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/709147e9052c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A security robot in Washington -- lovingly named Steve -- plunged down four steps into a fountain Monday." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1037" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/76a4b3f19ac8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Knightscope security robot goes viral after fountain fall" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1052" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7c5d3986ab99> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1037] Steve had just started patrolling the Washington Harbour, a riverside complex in Georgetown with restaurants and offices. [1037] The Washington Harbour and its real estate developer, MRP Realty, introduced the robot on Facebook on July 12." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1037" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/87308686e12a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Knightscope K5 security robot’s job is to be on the look out for crime." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1061" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/88206f43db5f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Presumably, the robot is equipped with computer vision software that should be able to detect obstacles, like bodies of water, or cars." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1044" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a41b1299a572> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The K5 autonomous robot was patrolling outside the Washington Harbour office and retail complex on Tuesday (New Zealand time) when it tumbled into the fountain." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1041" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b7f57db17a07> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But not, evidently, the water feature of The Washington Harbour, an office and retail complex in Washington, DC." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1036" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d2611c2e5fc8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The K5 autonomous robot was patrolling outside the Washington Harbour office and retail complex on Tuesday (New Zealand time) when it tumbled into the fountain." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1041" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d50bfdf20b4d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Knightscope, a Silicon Valley start-up, said in a statement that the incident was under investigation, pointing out that no one was hurt." ;
